                <head ana="#head_untitled-missing-head-in-printed-volume">[Untitled]</head>
                <opener>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right">
                        <placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps">British Consulate General,</hi>
                            <hi rendition="#italic">Havana,</hi></placeName>
                        <date calendar="gregorian" when="1863-06-28"><hi rendition="#italic"
                                >June</hi> 28, 1863.</date></dateline></opener>
                <p>I do hereby certify that the above document is a true and faithful copy, word for
                    word, compared, of an affidavit extended at this office, the day and date
                    therein mentioned, and registered at folios 308, 309 and 310 of Records, Book F,
                    in the archives of this consulate.</p>
                <closer>
                    <signed>JOHN V. CRAWFORD, <hi rendition="#italic">Acting Consul General, in
                            Cuba,</hi></signed></closer>
            </div>
